---
import IndexLayout from "../layouts/index.astro";
import PhaseCardGrid from "../components/home/phase_card_grid.astro";
import HomeGate from "../components/home/home_gate.astro";

const phase_cards = [
  {
    phase_name: "Writing",
    phase_slug: "writing",
    phase_blurb:
      "Unhinged fragments of a broken psyche, and pieces trying to reach their becoming. A writer is my main aspiration, however far-fetched it might be.",
  },
  {
    phase_name: "Work",
    phase_slug: "work",
    phase_blurb:
      "The things I have built for others: original tools, enormous systems, simple websites… the list grows every day.",
  },
  {
    phase_name: "About",
    phase_slug: "about",
    phase_blurb:
      "The creature tending this place, who Sol is, and how to find me.",
  },
];
---

<IndexLayout
  page_title="Our Hearth"
  banner_title="Solarisael"
  hide_breadcrumbs={true}
>
  <HomeGate>
    <Fragment slot="intro">
      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        Call me Sol, and try to enjoy the five minutes you can linger before
        going back to doom-scrolling.
      </p>
      <p class="sol__home_intro_aside">
        (I don’t judge you, I’d do the same hehe~)
      </p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">I am… a nobody above all else.</p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        We must never forget our origins after all.
      </p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        Many many years have I spent ignoring my reflection…
      </p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">It was like a ghost.</p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">Insistently trying, again and again.</p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">All it ever wanted was to warn me.</p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        To prevent me from becoming a simple man with too many regrets to count.
      </p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        This whole website is… a tiny… <strong>first step</strong>, let’s say. A
        public place to showcase everything that <strong>I was</strong>, that
        <strong>I am</strong>, and <strong>trying to be</strong>.
      </p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        Consider this place a tiny grove for my <strong>work</strong>,
        <strong>thoughts</strong>, <strong>records</strong>,
        <strong>experiments</strong>, and the <strong>strange things</strong>
        that never quite got to becoming.
      </p>

      <p class="sol__home_intro_line">
        I’d like it a lot if you critiqued my <strong>writing</strong>, in all
        its registers from <strong>unhinged</strong> to
        <strong>somewhat palatable</strong>.
      </p>
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="heading">Three Paths</Fragment>

    <PhaseCardGrid phase_cards={phase_cards} />
  </HomeGate>
</IndexLayout>
